message: If you use this software, please cite the associated manuscript.
title: Robot transparency in human-in-the-loop robot learning
abstract: >-
  Implementation and analysis code for a study of uncertainty displays and active
  intervention requests in human-in-the-loop reinforcement learning, evaluated
  against a population of parameterised simulated supervisors.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/baobingzhang/robot-transparency-hitl
